[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走在惩罚室所在的过道上，<br>突然遇到了雪莉和梅露露。|#0102Adv20_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，艾玛！<br>我就知道你会来这里。<br>毕竟来这里调查可是搜查的基础！|#0102Adv20_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是啊……<br>刚才大家都很恐慌，<br>我觉得还是得好好调查一番……|#0102Adv20_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（可是，说实话……我不忍心再目睹那个场面……）|#0102Adv20_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉，梅露露，<br>你们发现什么了吗？|#0102Adv20_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:……没有，目前还没什么收获……<br>只知道惩罚室前的过道光线很暗。|#0102Adv20_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:非要说的话，也就发现了这个吧。|#0102Adv20_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉把刚才拽掉的锁<br>递给艾玛。|#0102Adv20_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

