@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:2-2
@UpdateWitchBook Id:2-2 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我把锁弄坏了，<br>之后不会挨骂吧……？|#0102Adv20_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:应该不会……|#0102Adv20_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（惩罚室的门上了锁，<br>　房门是关着的）|#0102Adv20_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我们赶过来的时候门是锁着的，<br>　打不开房门）|#0102Adv20_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（既然如此，到底是谁，<br>　又是怎么捅伤米莉亚的……）|#0102Adv20_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这就是所谓的那个吧！经典的那个！|#0102Adv20_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，你是说……密室杀人？|#0102Adv20_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:没错没错～！|#0102Adv20_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我就知道雪莉会很兴奋……）|#0102Adv20_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:慎重起见，我也调查了一下<br>其他惩罚室的门能不能开……但是都不行。|#0102Adv20_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所有房间都上了锁，<br>只有米莉亚小姐所在的惩罚室能进。|#0102Adv20_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我也不太想调查米莉亚的尸体，<br>但现在能做的只有这一件事了。|#0102Adv20_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这次典狱长大人<br>没说不能进去，<br>而且我们也没有时间了，走吧！|#0102Adv20_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯……|#0102Adv20_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

