[PrintTextModified Text:再度观察整个惩罚室，<br>能看到里面放了很多可以用作凶器的东西。|#0102Adv20_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_26_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:"（感觉只要有办法进来，<br>　杀人本身就很容易做到）|#0102Adv20_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可就算是这样，<br>　也不该刺杀被绑在十字架上的米莉亚……）|#0102Adv20_Ema012|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛带着痛苦的表情<br>战战兢兢地看向米莉亚那边。|#0102Adv20_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:280_1

[PrintTextModified Text:被束缚在十字架上的米莉亚的尸体<br>仍维持着先前的状态。|#0102Adv20_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来她的腹部被捅了很多刀呢……|#0102Adv20_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉立即掏出手机，<br>开始拍摄室内的照片。|#0102Adv20_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

