[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……惩罚室里<br>到处都是可以用来行凶的刀具。|#0102Adv20_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:凶手可能是就近随手捡了把刀<br>把米莉亚捅死了吧……|#0102Adv20_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你是说出于冲动杀人吗……|#0102Adv20_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

