[PrintTextModified Text:我、我……<br>去调查一下米莉亚小姐的尸体……|#0102Adv20_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露眼角挂着泪水，<br>但还是神情坚定地说道。|#0102Adv20_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别、别这样，梅露露，不要勉强自己……！|#0102Adv20_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没、没关系的……！<br>调查一下尸体<br>也许能找到什么线索……|#0102Adv20_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露向米莉亚的尸体伸出手，<br>开始到处调查起来。|#0102Adv20_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的手发着光，<br>大概是想施法治愈米莉亚。|#0102Adv20_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（梅露露……）|#0102Adv20_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想愈合她的伤口……可是，<br>我的魔法却这么没用……|#0102Adv20_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露一边不停地悄悄流泪，<br>一边满怀怜悯地调查米莉亚的尸体。<br>忽然，她的手停住了。|#0102Adv20_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是……|#0102Adv20_Meruru008| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你发现了什么吗！？|#0102Adv20_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是的。米莉亚小姐的嘴里……<br>有个钥匙。|#0102Adv20_Meruru009| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

